00:23:03.830 --> 00:23:05.178
This is a global problem.

00:23:05.178 --> 00:23:11.580
So, we are in a really bad state of
affairs right now, in my opinion.

00:23:11.580 --> 00:23:16.810
It is eroding the core foundations
