00:24:45.860 --> 00:24:49.845
We curate our lives around this
perceived sense of perfection,

00:24:49.845 --> 00:24:54.271
because we get rewarded in these
short term signals, hearts, likes,

00:24:54.271 --> 00:24:59.030
