00:25:21.360 --> 00:25:25.160
then think about how people react
then to the perceptions of others.

00:25:25.160 --> 00:25:28.646
It's just a it's really bad,
it's really,really bad.

00:25:28.646 --> 00:25:31.621
&gt;&gt; It sounds like you're taking deep

