00:50:10.610 --> 00:50:14.760
And I think part of my bias came from my
insecurity about not having a grad degree.

00:50:14.760 --> 00:50:18.932
Part of my bias was looking at
people like you and saying, wow,

00:50:18.932 --> 00:50:24.000
I just feel inferior to folks like you,
I have felt for huge amounts of time.

00:50:24.000 --> 00:50:29.330
And so it's a perfect example, where
